WEBVTT

video-title-observation
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Kuyang'ana ndi kuyeza pogwiritsa ntchito chida chokulitsa

observation-01
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:09.700
Yang'anani dera lozungulira maso, zikope ndi maso. Lembani chilichonse chachilendo.

observation-02
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Kenako yezeni diso ndi chida chokulitsa chithunzi. Konzani Arclight ndi kusankha kuwala kwamphamvu kwambiri.

observation-03
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.500
Gwirani chipangizocho pafupi ndi diso lanu. Yandikirani diso lakumanja la wodwala pang'onopang'ono mpaka litaoneka bwino.

observation-04
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.500
Pemphani wodwalayo kuti ayang'ane kumanja kenako kumanzere.

observation-05
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:46.800
Kenako mupempheni kuti ayang'ane mmwamba ndi pansi mutagwira zikope zake mofatsa. Yang'anani mbali zosiyanasiyana za diso m'magulu.

structures-01
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Gulu loyamba lili ndi nsidze za zikope zapamwamba ndi zapansi, komanso m'mphepete mwa zikopezo.

structures-02
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.450
Gulu lachiwiri lili ndi nembanemba yophimba diso ndi mbali yoyera ya diso,

structures-03
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.100
kuphatikizapo khola la nembanembayo pansi pa chikope.

structures-04
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.900
Gulu lachitatu lili ndi khungu lowonekera lakutsogolo kwa diso, lotchedwa cornea,

structures-05
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:19.400
ndi malire ake pamene limakumana ndi mbali yoyera ya diso. Malirewa amatchedwa limbus.

structures-06
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.700
Lilinso ndi mwana wa diso, amene wazunguliridwa ndi mbali ya mtundu ya diso, yotchedwa iris.

conditions-01
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Izi ndi zithunzi za mavuto osiyanasiyana a maso. Tengani nthawi yoona bwinobwino pogwiritsa ntchito Arclight.

video-title-chamber-depth
00:01:38.433 --> 00:01:45.800
Kuya kwa chipinda chakutsogolo cha diso

chamber-depth-01
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:46.850
Chipinda chakutsogolo cha diso ndi malo pakati pa cornea ndi iris.

chamber-depth-02
00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:53.000
Mungayerekezere kuya kwa chipinda chakutsogolo powunikira kuchokera mbali ya khutu.

chamber-depth-03
00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.100
Mthunzi kumbali ya mphuno ungasonyeze kuti chipindacho n'chosaya. Tumizani wodwala kuti akayesedwe.

video-title-fluorescein
00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:04.100
Kuyika utoto wa fluorescein pa cornea

fluorescein-application
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:09.600
Ikani fluorescein m'diso pogwiritsa ntchito kachidutswa ka fluorescein kapena botolo laling'ono la Minims.

fluorescein-01
00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:14.000
Sankhani kuwala kwabuluu ndipo yang'anani cornea.

fluorescein-02
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:23.500
Malo owonongeka pamwamba pa cornea ndi madera a matenda adzaoneka. Lembani malo ake ndi kukula kwake.

video-title-lid-eversion
00:02:27.133 --> 00:02:30.367
Kutembenuza chikope chakumtunda

lid-eversion-grip
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:36.700
Gwirani mofatsa nsidze za chikope chakumtunda ndi chala chachikulu ndi chala cholozera.

lid-eversion-01
00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:42.200
Ikani kandodo ka thonje pa chikope chakumtunda monga potsamira ndipo tembenuzirani chikopecho mmwamba.

lid-eversion-02
00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:47.700
Gwirani chikope chotembenuzidwacho. Yambani kuyang'ana mkati mwake ndi maso anu,

lid-eversion-03
00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:51.400
kenako yandikitsani Arclight kuti muone bwino chokulitsidwa.
